Network In/Out
ALB request count


Cannot use your custom Ganz/Webkinz metrics
AWS creates and manages the alarms internally — you never see them


Option 3 — Scheduled Scaling (no alarm needed)
Scale up at 9am, Scale down at 6pm

Time-based only — no metrics involved
Good for predictable traffic patterns


