        ↓
AWS returns temporary credentials to the instance
        ↓
Java app uses those credentials automatically
        ↓
Java app can publish to Ganz/Webkinz namespace
The Java app uses the AWS SDK default credential chain — it automatically picks up the role credentials from the EC2 metadata service without any hardcoded keys.

